<title>USA: TABLE - Ascent Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Ascent Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Mass. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ascent Pediatrics Inc</p>
<p>			  (in thousand, except per share)</p>
<p>				Three months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					    June 30,     June 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>Revenue			$0	   $0	   $0	   $0</p>
<p>Net loss		(2,453)    (1,255)    (4,892)    (2,133)</p>
<p>Net loss per share  ( 0.74)    ( 1.25)    ( 2.35)    ( 2.12)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common and common equivalent</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 3,360,103  1,007,218  2,190,161  1,007,090</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the losses for both the quarter and six months  are reflective of the company's increased expenditures to establish  sales and marketing programs in anticipation of product launches in  the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>In addition, the Company has increased expenditures in development  activities related to its Primsol, albuterol and acetaminophen product  programs.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
